{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H38310","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H37100","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 224 - 198, 2 Present (Roll no. 62). (text: 03/05/2025 CR H998)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"8000","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Passed/agreed to in House: On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 224 - 198, 2 Present (Roll no. 62). (text: 03/05/2025 CR H998)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-03-06","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H1019-1020)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H. Res. 189, the Chair put the question on agreeing to the resolution and by voice vote announced that the ayes had prevailed. Mr. McGovern demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H. Res. 189.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36510","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"On motion to table Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 209 - 211, 1 Present (Roll no. 60).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36500","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"Ms. Clark (MA) moved to table the measure.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-03-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"C